 *
 * These helpers redact sensitive data (credentials, tokens, PEM blocks, etc.)
 * from strings and structured tool arguments before they are surfaced to the
 * user via live progress output. The regexes are written to be resilient
 * against ReDoS: PEM detection uses a fully lazy scan with no ambiguous
 * adjacent quantifiers, so incomplete PEM-like input is processed in linear
